# Read-Before-Write Rule

Before modifying any file:

1. Identify boundaries — interfaces, types, schemas, lock contracts
2. Read upstream via @filename
3. For capture/DNG/GLES/fleet/chrome: also read `docs/AGENT_REGRESSION_MEMORY.md` and relevant `.cursor/rules/*-lock.mdc`
4. State signatures in plan when non-trivial
5. Then edit

## Critique Checklist

- Null/empty values
- Race conditions / session lifecycle
- Unhandled exceptions
- USB proof requirements before claiming delivery

## UTF-8 & Verification

- Write all text files as UTF-8 without BOM (never UTF-16)
- Never mark BUILD_PLAN tasks ✅ without running validate scripts / gates
- After bootstrap surface changes: `.\scripts\pns_validate_bootstrap.ps1`
